      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You're right to be skeptical, but that doesn't mean the effort is futile—it just means the \"anchor\" isn't a grand monument, it's a personal tool. Think of it as a lifeline you can drop into the void to steady yourself, not a final solution. The point isn't to escape the void, but to give the void a little warmth while you're in it.",
